msgstr "Ler a história"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
#, javascript-format
msgid "More than 95% of Smarter's code is covered by its automated tests."
msgstr ""
"Mais de 95% do código do Smarter é coberto por seus testes automatizados."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read how it got there"
msgstr "Ler como chegou lá"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter is a Docker application that runs on Debian Linux, so it can run "
"anywhere, from your own laptop to any data center in the world."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter é uma aplicação Docker que roda em Debian Linux, então pode rodar "
"em qualquer lugar, do seu próprio notebook a qualquer data center do mundo."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read why Smarter uses Docker"
msgstr "Ler por que o Smarter usa Docker"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "You can install Smarter on your own laptop in around 20 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Você pode instalar o Smarter no seu próprio notebook em cerca de 20 minutos."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts, react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/Component.tsx
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "Começar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter closely follows the 12-Factor App methodology, a set of principles "
"for building software that runs in the cloud."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter segue de perto a metodologia 12-Factor App, um conjunto de "
"princípios para criar software que roda na nuvem."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read the 12-Factor App decision"
msgstr "Ler a decisão sobre o 12-Factor App"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's web console users can watch the real server logs of their own "
"prompts, live, as the server writes them."
msgstr ""
"Os usuários do console web do Smarter podem acompanhar os logs reais do "
"servidor dos seus próprios prompts, ao vivo, enquanto o servidor os escreve."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the live server logs"
msgstr "Ler sobre os logs do servidor ao vivo"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's major design decisions, from Django and Kubernetes to Pydantic, "
"are written down as Architecture Decision Records in its documentation."
msgstr ""
"As principais decisões de design do Smarter, do Django e Kubernetes ao "
"Pydantic, estão registradas como Architecture Decision Records em sua "
"documentação."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read the Architecture Decision Records"
msgstr "Ler os Architecture Decision Records"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Every Smarter platform runs an MCP server that answers questions about The "
"Smarter Project from its own source code and documentation."
msgstr ""
"Cada plataforma Smarter executa um servidor MCP que responde a perguntas "
"sobre o The Smarter Project a partir do seu próprio código-fonte e "
"documentação."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the MCP server"
msgstr "Ler sobre o servidor MCP"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter has SDKs for Python, Node.js and Go, a command-line interface "
"written in Go, and a VS Code extension for its YAML manifests."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter tem SDKs para Python, Node.js e Go, uma interface de linha de "
"comando escrita em Go e uma extensão do VS Code para seus manifestos YAML."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "See the APIs and SDKs"
msgstr "Ver as APIs e os SDKs"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"The Smarter Project was inspired by the Kubernetes Project, which is open "
"source software for declarative cloud infrastructure management."
msgstr ""
"O The Smarter Project foi inspirado no projeto Kubernetes, um software open "
"source para o gerenciamento declarativo de infraestrutura em nuvem."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about manifests"
msgstr "Ler sobre os manifestos"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's manifests are programmed with Pydantic, the popular open source "
"Python data validation library on PyPI."
msgstr ""
"Os manifestos do Smarter são programados com Pydantic, a popular biblioteca "
"open source de validação de dados em Python, disponível no PyPI."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read why Smarter uses Pydantic"
msgstr "Ler por que o Smarter usa Pydantic"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's repository has Agent Skills: instructions that teach AI coding "
"agents its conventions, from its tests to its translations."
msgstr ""
"O repositório do Smarter tem Agent Skills: instruções que ensinam suas "
"convenções aos agentes de programação com IA, dos testes às traduções."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Browse the skills"
msgstr "Explorar as skills"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter was first used in a classroom in January 2026, by AI students at the "
"University of British Columbia."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter foi usado pela primeira vez em sala de aula em janeiro de 2026, "
"por estudantes de IA da University of British Columbia."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read the Instructor Guide"
msgstr "Ler o Guia do instrutor"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter has a Free Course Catalog of ready-to-teach courses, from prompt "
"engineering for non-programmers to Kubernetes for platform engineers."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter tem um Catálogo de cursos gratuitos prontos para ensinar, de "
"engenharia de prompts para quem não programa a Kubernetes para engenheiros "
"de plataforma."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Every Smarter account starts with two course advisors, stackademy_sql and "
"stackademy_api, that answer from a private database and a web API with no "
"code. A case study on smarter.sh teaches how they work."
msgstr ""
"Toda conta do Smarter começa com dois orientadores acadêmicos, "
"stackademy_sql e stackademy_api, que respondem a partir de um banco de dados "
"privado e de uma API web, sem código. Um estudo de caso em smarter.sh ensina "
"como eles funcionam."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read the case study"
msgstr "Ler o estudo de caso"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"The chat in the Prompt Engineer's Workbench is its own open source npm "
"package, @smarter.sh/ui-chat, which you can embed in any website."
msgstr ""
"O chat do Prompt Engineer's Workbench é um pacote npm open source próprio, "
"@smarter.sh/ui-chat, que você pode incorporar em qualquer site."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "See it on npm"
msgstr "Ver no npm"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Claude Code translated Smarter's web console into Spanish, French and "
"Brazilian Portuguese in a single day, October 16, 2026."
msgstr ""
"O Claude Code traduziu o console web do Smarter para espanhol, francês e "
"português do Brasil em um único dia, 16 de outubro de 2026."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the translations"
msgstr "Ler sobre as traduções"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's ImageSearchPlugin was written by Claude Code during a live, in-"
"class demonstration for AI students at the University of British Columbia. "
"It went into production the following day."
msgstr ""
"O ImageSearchPlugin do Smarter foi escrito pelo Claude Code durante uma "
"demonstração ao vivo, em sala de aula, para estudantes de IA da University "
"of British Columbia. Ele entrou em produção no dia seguinte."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the ImageSearchPlugin"
msgstr "Ler sobre o ImageSearchPlugin"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"The web console speaks English, Spanish, French and Brazilian Portuguese. "
"You can choose a language from the user menu."
msgstr ""
"O console web fala inglês, espanhol, francês e português do Brasil. Você "
"pode escolher um idioma no menu do usuário."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat has a WordPress plugin, a Drupal module and a Shopify app "
"block, which put a deployed LLMClient on your site."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter Chat tem um plugin para WordPress, um módulo para Drupal e um "
"bloco de app para Shopify, que colocam um LLMClient implantado no seu site."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about Smarter Chat"
msgstr "Ler sobre o Smarter Chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's manifests can be edited not only in the web console, but also in "
"code editors such as VS Code."
msgstr ""
"Os manifestos do Smarter podem ser editados não só no console web, mas "
"também em editores de código como o VS Code."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the VS Code extension"
msgstr "Ler sobre a extensão do VS Code"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's VS Code extension checks your YAML manifests as you type, "
"completes their keys and values, and fixes common mistakes."
msgstr ""
"A extensão do VS Code do Smarter verifica seus manifestos YAML enquanto você "
"digita, completa suas chaves e valores e corrige erros comuns."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's command-line interface works much like kubectl and runs on "
"Windows, macOS and Linux. Like the aws cli, you set it up with one command: "
"smarter configure."
msgstr ""
"A interface de linha de comando do Smarter funciona de forma muito parecida "
"com o kubectl e roda em Windows, macOS e Linux. Como a aws cli, ela é "
"configurada com um único comando: smarter configure."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the command-line interface"
msgstr "Ler sobre a interface de linha de comando"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"On a Mac, you can install the smarter command-line interface with Homebrew."
msgstr ""
"Em um Mac, você pode instalar a interface de linha de comando smarter com o "
"Homebrew."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Every Smarter platform publishes an OpenAPI document of its REST API, which "
"SDKs and AI agents can read."
msgstr ""
"Cada plataforma Smarter publica um documento OpenAPI da sua API REST, que "
"SDKs e agentes de IA podem ler."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the OpenAPI document"
msgstr "Ler sobre o documento OpenAPI"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's server log messages are designed to help AI agents diagnose run-"
"time errors: each one starts with the dotted path of the code that wrote it, "
"so it reads like a stack trace."
msgstr ""
"As mensagens de log do servidor do Smarter são projetadas para ajudar "
"agentes de IA a diagnosticar erros em tempo de execução: cada uma começa com "
"o caminho pontuado do código que a escreveu, então ela se lê como um stack "
"trace."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read the logging style guide"
msgstr "Ler o guia de estilo de logs"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter has more than 50 Waffle switches that turn optional features and "
"logging on and off, including whether these Did you know? notes appear."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter tem mais de 50 chaves do Waffle que ativam e desativam recursos "
"opcionais e logs, inclusive se estas notas de Você sabia? aparecem."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the Waffle switches"
msgstr "Ler sobre as chaves do Waffle"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's authors invented their own object caching system, the "
"@cache_results() decorator, which builds each cache key from the arguments "
"of the function that it caches."
msgstr ""
"Os autores do Smarter inventaram seu próprio sistema de cache de objetos, o "
"decorador @cache_results(), que monta cada chave de cache a partir dos "
"argumentos da função que ele armazena em cache."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about @cache_results()"
msgstr "Ler sobre @cache_results()"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's authors created their own Django base model, "
"MetaDataWithOwnershipModel, which gives each AI resource its name, "
"description, version, tags and owner."
msgstr ""
"Os autores do Smarter criaram seu próprio modelo base do Django, "
"MetaDataWithOwnershipModel, que dá a cada recurso de IA seu nome, descrição, "
"versão, tags e proprietário."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read its source code"
msgstr "Ler seu código-fonte"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's version numbers and changelogs are generated from its commit "
"messages, by semantic-release."
msgstr ""
"Os números de versão e os registros de alterações do Smarter são gerados a "
"partir de suas mensagens de commit, pelo semantic-release."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "See the releases"
msgstr "Ver as versões"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter's authors designed their own Django-React integration: Vite builds "
"each page's React app, and a Django template tag mounts it."
msgstr ""
"Os autores do Smarter criaram sua própria integração entre Django e React: o "
"Vite compila o app React de cada página, e uma template tag do Django o "
"monta."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read about the React integration"
msgstr "Ler sobre a integração com React"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Most pages of this web console are small React apps that Django hosts, and "
"every one of their Storybook stories also runs as a unit test."
msgstr ""
"A maioria das páginas deste console web são pequenos apps React hospedados "
"pelo Django, e cada uma de suas histórias do Storybook também é executada "
"como teste unitário."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter is an open source project, and anyone can contribute to it, "
"including you."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter é um projeto open source, e qualquer pessoa pode contribuir, "
"inclusive você."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read how to contribute"
msgstr "Ler como contribuir"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"The Get Weather LLMClient's tool is a Smarter Extension written in Python. "
"Beginning Python programmers can write extensions too."
msgstr ""
"A ferramenta do LLMClient Get Weather é uma Smarter Extension escrita em "
"Python. Quem está começando a programar em Python também pode escrever "
"extensões."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid "Read the extension developer guide"
msgstr "Ler o guia de desenvolvimento de extensões"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
msgid ""
"Smarter Extensions, such as weather, calculator and date-calculator, are "
"published in a public registry on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"As Smarter Extensions, como weather, calculator e date-calculator, são "
"publicadas em um registro público no GitHub."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-didyouknow/src/lib/facts.ts
