#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Open this LLMClient's manifest"
msgstr "Abra o manifesto deste LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Click Copy on the example, and paste it into the manifest."
msgstr "Clique em Copiar no exemplo e cole-o no manifesto."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Click Save. Smarter applies the manifest at once. Then reload this tab, and "
"the new resource appears in the tree."
msgstr ""
"Clique em Salvar. O Smarter aplica o manifesto imediatamente. Depois "
"recarregue esta aba, e o novo recurso aparece na árvore."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Choose it"
msgstr "Escolha esta opção"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Paste it at the start of a new line beneath %(spec)s. If the manifest "
"already has the same key with an empty list, such as %(empty)s, replace that "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Cole-o no início de uma nova linha abaixo de %(spec)s. Se o manifesto já "
"tiver a mesma chave com uma lista vazia, como %(empty)s, substitua essa "
"linha."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "Próximos passos"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Make this LLMClient your own"
msgstr "Deixe este LLMClient com a sua cara"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Most LLMClients have Guardrails, tools, a look of their own and an api key. "
"This one is missing some of them. Each takes a few lines of YAML: copy an "
"example below into the manifest, and save it."
msgstr ""
"A maioria dos LLMClients tem guardrails, ferramentas, uma aparência própria "
"e uma chave de API. Faltam alguns a este. Cada um exige poucas linhas de "
"YAML: copie um exemplo abaixo para o manifesto e salve-o."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Add your first Guardrail"
msgstr "Adicione seu primeiro guardrail"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"A Guardrail screens the text that passes between the user and the LLM. An "
"input Guardrail checks each prompt before it is sent to the LLM, and an "
"output Guardrail checks each response before the user sees it. When it finds "
"what it looks for, such as an email address, a prompt injection or a leaked "
"password, it blocks the message, redacts what it found, or logs it."
msgstr ""
"Um guardrail filtra o texto que passa entre o usuário e o LLM. Um guardrail "
"de entrada verifica cada prompt antes de ele ser enviado ao LLM, e um "
"guardrail de saída verifica cada resposta antes de o usuário vê-la. Quando "
"encontra o que procura, como um endereço de e-mail, uma injeção de prompt ou "
"uma senha vazada, ele bloqueia a mensagem, oculta o que encontrou ou o "
"registra."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Guardrails are ordinary software, not the LLM's judgment, so they enforce "
"your rules however the LLM behaves. Smarter comes with built-in Guardrails "
"for the most common cases, which every LLMClient may use by name: personal "
"data, secrets, prompt injection, moderation, off-topic prompts and more."
msgstr ""
"Guardrails são software comum, não o julgamento do LLM, então aplicam suas "
"regras independentemente de como o LLM se comporta. O Smarter inclui "
"guardrails integrados para os casos mais comuns, que qualquer LLMClient pode "
"usar pelo nome: dados pessoais, segredos, injeção de prompt, moderação, "
"prompts fora do tema e mais."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse the Guardrails"
msgstr "Explorar os guardrails"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Built-in Guardrails"
msgstr "Guardrails integrados"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Two built-in Guardrails"
msgstr "Dois guardrails integrados"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"%(pii)s removes credit card numbers, email addresses and phone numbers from "
"each prompt, and %(injection)s blocks prompts that try to override the "
"LLMClient's instructions. Neither calls an LLM."
msgstr ""
"%(pii)s remove números de cartão de crédito, endereços de e-mail e números "
"de telefone de cada prompt, e %(injection)s bloqueia prompts que tentam "
"sobrepor as instruções do LLMClient. Nenhum dos dois chama um LLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Add your first tool"
msgstr "Adicione sua primeira ferramenta"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An LLM knows only what it was trained on and what is in its prompt. Tools "
"give it everything else: today's weather, a row in your database, a "
"calculation that it would otherwise guess at. Smarter offers the LLM the "
"tools that the LLMClient lists, the LLM decides when to call one, and "
"Smarter runs it and hands back the result."
msgstr ""
"Um LLM só sabe aquilo com que foi treinado e o que está no seu prompt. As "
"ferramentas lhe dão todo o resto: o clima de hoje, uma linha do seu banco de "
"dados, um cálculo que de outra forma ele adivinharia. O Smarter oferece ao "
"LLM as ferramentas que o LLMClient lista, o LLM decide quando chamar uma, e "
"o Smarter a executa e devolve o resultado."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"There are three ways to add tools, which differ in who writes them and where "
"they run. An LLMClient may use all three at once."
msgstr ""
"Há três maneiras de adicionar ferramentas, que diferem em quem as escreve e "
"onde são executadas. Um LLMClient pode usar as três ao mesmo tempo."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Plugins"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"A plugin is a manifest that configures one of Smarter's built-in tool "
"patterns: answer from static data, run a SQL query, call a REST api, follow "
"a skill, search the web, or search for images. Nothing is coded or "
"installed, and it runs on Smarter."
msgstr ""
"Um plugin é um manifesto que configura um dos padrões de ferramenta "
"integrados do Smarter: responder a partir de dados estáticos, executar uma "
"consulta SQL, chamar uma api REST, seguir uma skill, pesquisar na web ou "
"pesquisar imagens. Nada é programado nem instalado, e ele é executado no "
"Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "for your own data, databases and apis, without writing code."
msgstr "para seus próprios dados, bancos de dados e apis, sem escrever código."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"A sample static plugin about a fictional candy, which needs no Connection or "
"Secret. Then ask the LLMClient about the Everlasting Gobstopper."
msgstr ""
"Um plugin estático de exemplo sobre um doce fictício, que não precisa de "
"conexão nem de segredo. Depois pergunte ao LLMClient sobre o Everlasting "
"Gobstopper."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse the plugins"
msgstr "Explorar os plugins"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An Extension is Python code, packaged and published to the Smarter Extension "
"registry, that a platform administrator installs, much as a WordPress "
"administrator installs a plugin. Its tools do whatever Python can do, and "
"they run on Smarter."
msgstr ""
"Uma extensão é código Python, empacotado e publicado no registro de Smarter "
"Extensions, que um administrador da plataforma instala, assim como um "
"administrador do WordPress instala um plugin. Suas ferramentas fazem tudo o "
"que o Python pode fazer, e são executadas no Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"when a tool needs real code, or for a ready-made tool that is already "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"quando uma ferramenta precisa de código de verdade, ou para uma ferramenta "
"pronta que já está instalada."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An official Extension, which does arithmetic exactly. The Extensions page "
"lists those that are installed on this platform."
msgstr ""
"Uma extensão oficial, que faz cálculos aritméticos exatos. A página "
"Extensões lista as que estão instaladas nesta plataforma."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse the Extensions"
msgstr "Explorar as extensões"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An MCPClient is a manifest that connects to a remote MCP server: a third "
"party's tools, published with the Model Context Protocol. Smarter offers the "
"server's tools to the LLM and calls them on that server. Nothing is coded, "
"and nothing runs on Smarter."
msgstr ""
"Um MCPClient é um manifesto que se conecta a um servidor MCP remoto: as "
"ferramentas de um terceiro, publicadas com o Model Context Protocol. O "
"Smarter oferece as ferramentas do servidor ao LLM e as chama nesse servidor. "
"Nada é programado, e nada é executado no Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"for a service that already publishes an MCP server, such as GitHub, Notion "
"or Stripe."
msgstr ""
"para um serviço que já publica um servidor MCP, como GitHub, Notion ou "
"Stripe."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"An example MCPClient for DeepWiki, which documents public GitHub "
"repositories, and requires no authentication."
msgstr ""
"Um MCPClient de exemplo para o DeepWiki, que documenta repositórios públicos "
"do GitHub e não exige autenticação."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse the MCPClients"
msgstr "Explorar os MCPClients"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Plugins, Extensions and MCP servers compared"
msgstr "Plugins, extensões e servidores MCP comparados"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Extensibility"
msgstr "Extensibilidade"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Style its chat"
msgstr "Personalize o estilo do chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient's chat has Smarter's default look. A few lines of styles give "
"it yours: your logo in the header, your colors on the message bubbles, your "
"font, a picture behind the conversation. They apply in the workbench and on "
"every web page that embeds the chat. You don't need to know CSS, and every "
"setting is optional."
msgstr ""
"O chat deste LLMClient tem a aparência padrão do Smarter. Algumas linhas de "
"estilos dão a ele a sua: seu logotipo no cabeçalho, suas cores nos balões "
"das mensagens, sua fonte, uma imagem atrás da conversa. Eles se aplicam no "
"workbench e em cada página web que incorpora o chat. Você não precisa saber "
"CSS, e todas as configurações são opcionais."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Styles go in %(styles)s, beside %(prompt)s: paste it at the start of the "
"line after the last line of %(prompt)s, with the same indent as %(prompt)s."
msgstr ""
"Os estilos ficam em %(styles)s, ao lado de %(prompt)s: cole-o no início da "
"linha seguinte à última linha de %(prompt)s, com o mesmo recuo de %(prompt)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Styling your LLMClient's chat"
msgstr "Estilos do chat do seu LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "The chat's styles"
msgstr "Os estilos do chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter's logo, the Inter font, a dark header, and the user's messages in "
"orange. Swap in your own logo's url and colors."
msgstr ""
"O logotipo do Smarter, a fonte Inter, um cabeçalho escuro e as mensagens do "
"usuário em laranja. Troque a url do logotipo e as cores pelas suas."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Add an api key"
msgstr "Adicione uma chave de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Without an api key, this LLMClient is public once it is deployed: anyone who "
"has its url can chat with it, and every prompt is charged to its owner. "
"Attach an api key, and its url requires it: each request must send the key "
"in an %(header)s header, and Smarter refuses those that don't. The workbench "
"doesn't need the key, because you are signed in."
msgstr ""
"Sem uma chave de API, este LLMClient é público depois de implantado: "
"qualquer pessoa que tenha sua url pode conversar com ele, e cada prompt é "
"cobrado do proprietário. Vincule uma chave de API, e sua url passa a exigi-"
"la: cada solicitação deve enviar a chave em um cabeçalho %(header)s, e o "
"Smarter recusa as que não a enviam. A área de trabalho não precisa da chave, "
"porque você está conectado."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"The quickest way is this workbench's Deployment tab, which creates an api "
"key, shows its secret once, and attaches it, in one step. To attach a key "
"that you already have, name it in the manifest. An LLMClient has one api "
"key, and only an account admin can create one."
msgstr ""
"O jeito mais rápido é a aba Implantação desta área de trabalho, que cria uma "
"chave de API, mostra o segredo uma única vez e a vincula, em um só passo. "
"Para vincular uma chave que você já tem, informe o nome dela no manifesto. "
"Um LLMClient tem uma única chave de API, e somente um administrador da conta "
"pode criar uma."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Paste it at the start of a new line beneath %(spec)s. If the manifest "
"already has an %(apiKey)s line, replace that line."
msgstr ""
"Cole-o no início de uma nova linha abaixo de %(spec)s. Se o manifesto já "
"tiver uma linha %(apiKey)s, substitua essa linha."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "Browse your api keys"
msgstr "Navegue pelas suas chaves de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx
msgid "API Keys"
msgstr "Chaves de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "The LLMClient's api key"
msgstr "A chave de API do LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid ""
"Change %(name)s to the name of one of your own api keys, as the API Keys "
"page lists them."
msgstr ""
"Troque %(name)s pelo nome de uma das suas próprias chaves de API, como a "
"página Chaves de API as lista."

#. Translators: the tab of the Console that draws the tree of resources that the LLMClient is built from.
#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx, react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/Component.tsx
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Arquitetura"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "How this LLMClient is built"
msgstr "Como este LLMClient é construído"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid ""
"An LLMClient is a sophisticated solution, built artisanally from a "
"hierarchical tree of SAM resources. This is its tree: each card is a "
"resource that it uses, directly or through another resource."
msgstr ""
"Um LLMClient é uma solução sofisticada, construída artesanalmente a partir "
"de uma árvore hierárquica de recursos SAM. Esta é a sua árvore: cada cartão "
"é um recurso que ele usa, diretamente ou por meio de outro recurso."

#. Translators: SAM is the Smarter Application Manifest, a product name.
#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "Everything is a SAM resource"
msgstr "Tudo é um recurso SAM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "Smarter Application Manifests"
msgstr "Smarter Application Manifests"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid ""
"LLMClients, Providers, plugins, Connections, Secrets and Guardrails are all "
"SAM resources. Each is declared in a manifest, a short YAML document that "
"says what the resource should be, and Smarter makes it so."
msgstr ""
"LLMClients, provedores, plugins, conexões, segredos e guardrails são todos "
"recursos SAM. Cada um é declarado em um manifesto, um breve documento YAML "
"que diz como o recurso deve ser, e o Smarter o torna realidade."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "Edit any manifest here"
msgstr "Edite qualquer manifesto aqui"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "The web console"
msgstr "O console web"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid ""
"Every manifest can be edited directly in the web console. Click a card to "
"open its resource's manifest in a new tab, change it, and save it: Smarter "
"applies it at once."
msgstr ""
"Cada manifesto pode ser editado diretamente no console web. Clique em um "
"cartão para abrir o manifesto do recurso em uma nova aba, altere-o e salve-"
"o: o Smarter o aplica imediatamente."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "An LLMClient is a tree"
msgstr "Um LLMClient é uma árvore"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx, react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "LLMClients"
msgstr "LLMClients"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid "Dependency trees"
msgstr "Árvores de dependências"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/Introduction.tsx
msgid ""
"Its Provider supplies the LLM, its plugins and MCPClients give it tools, its "
"Guardrails screen what goes in and out, and the Connections and Secrets "
"beneath them reach your data, safely. A resource that two others use appears "
"under each of them."
msgstr ""
"Seu provedor fornece o LLM, seus plugins e MCPClients lhe dão ferramentas, "
"seus guardrails filtram o que entra e sai, e as conexões e segredos abaixo "
"deles alcançam seus dados, com segurança. Um recurso que outros dois usam "
"aparece sob cada um deles."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ManifestSnippet.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/CopyButton.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/EditorViewToolbar/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-serverlogs/src/components/ServerLogs.tsx
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Copiado"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-architecture/src/components/ManifestSnippet.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/CopyButton.tsx
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copiar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "No api key is attached: the url is public."
msgstr "Nenhuma chave de API está vinculada: a url é pública."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Every request to the url needs %(name)s."
msgstr "Toda solicitação à url precisa de %(name)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"%(name)s is attached, but turned off, so the url is public. Turn it on in "
"API Keys, or attach another key."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s está vinculada, mas desativada, então a url é pública. Ative-a em "
"Chaves de API, ou vincule outra chave."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Detach"
msgstr "Desvincular"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "snake_case: the name that the manifest's spec.apiKey uses."
msgstr "snake_case: o nome que spec.apiKey usa no manifesto."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "The chat on www.example.com"
msgstr "O chat em www.example.com"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Attach it to this LLMClient"
msgstr "Vincule-a a este LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Create the api key"
msgstr "Criar a chave de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Choose its api key"
msgstr "Escolha sua chave de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Copy its secret now"
msgstr "Copie o segredo agora"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"This is the secret of %(name)s. Smarter keeps only a hash of it, and can't "
"show it again: store it somewhere safe, such as a password manager or your "
"hosting's secrets. It is what your front end sends, in place of %"
"(placeholder)s."
msgstr ""
"Este é o segredo de %(name)s. O Smarter guarda apenas um hash dele e não "
"pode mostrá-lo de novo: guarde-o em um lugar seguro, como um gerenciador de "
"senhas ou os segredos da sua hospedagem. É o que o seu front end envia, no "
"lugar de %(placeholder)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Your account's api keys"
msgstr "As chaves de API da sua conta"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Last used"
msgstr "Último uso"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Nunca"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Attached"
msgstr "Vinculada"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "Attach"
msgstr "Vincular"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid "There are no api keys that you can manage yet."
msgstr "Ainda não há chaves de API que você possa gerenciar."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/lib/messages.ts
msgid ""
"Only the LLMClient's owner, or an account admin, can change its api key."
msgstr ""
"Somente o proprietário do LLMClient, ou um administrador da conta, pode "
"alterar sua chave de API."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Create an api key"
msgstr "Crie uma chave de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"The key is yours. Its secret is shown once, right after you create it. The "
"web console's API Keys page lists your keys, and turns a key off without "
"deleting it."
msgstr ""
"A chave é sua. O segredo é mostrado uma única vez, logo depois de criá-la. A "
"página Chaves de API do console web lista suas chaves e desativa uma chave "
"sem excluí-la."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ApiKeys.tsx
msgid ""
"Only an account admin can create api keys. Ask one to create a key for you, "
"then attach it here, or ask them to run:"
msgstr ""
"Somente um administrador da conta pode criar chaves de API. Peça a um que "
"crie uma chave para você e depois vincule-a aqui, ou peça que execute:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Conversations"
msgstr "Conversas"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Chat sessions"
msgstr "Sessões de chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Every conversation with %(app_name)s is a chat session, which the platform "
"identifies by a session key. The session's messages are stored on the "
"platform, so a conversation survives a page reload, or a visit to another "
"page: the chat sends its key, and the platform answers with the conversation "
"so far."
msgstr ""
"Cada conversa com %(app_name)s é uma sessão de chat, que a plataforma "
"identifica por uma chave de sessão. As mensagens da sessão ficam guardadas "
"na plataforma, então uma conversa sobrevive a um recarregamento da página, "
"ou a uma visita a outra página: o chat envia sua chave, e a plataforma "
"responde com a conversa até aquele momento."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "The platform makes it"
msgstr "A plataforma a cria"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"The first %(config)s request of a chat that has no key gets a new one, 64 "
"hexadecimal characters, in the response's %(field)s. Don't make up your own: "
"the platform checks its format."
msgstr ""
"A primeira solicitação %(config)s de um chat sem chave recebe uma nova, de "
"64 caracteres hexadecimais, no campo %(field)s da resposta. Não invente a "
"sua: a plataforma verifica o formato dela."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "The client keeps it"
msgstr "O cliente a guarda"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"The key is all that the client stores: the browser, or your own server. The "
"session's messages, and the platform's records of its tool calls and costs, "
"stay on the platform."
msgstr ""
"A chave é tudo o que o cliente guarda: o navegador, ou o seu próprio "
"servidor. As mensagens da sessão, e os registros da plataforma sobre suas "
"chamadas de ferramentas e seus custos, ficam na plataforma."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Forgetting it starts over"
msgstr "Esquecê-la recomeça"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"A %(config)s request without a key starts a new session, with a new key. "
"That is all that Smarter Chat's New chat button does."
msgstr ""
"Uma solicitação %(config)s sem chave inicia uma sessão nova, com uma chave "
"nova. É só isso que o botão de novo chat do Smarter Chat faz."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Smarter Chat does it for you"
msgstr "O Smarter Chat faz isso por você"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat keeps the key in a cookie, %(cookie)s by default, for one day, "
"and for the page's path, so that each page has its own conversation. Set %"
"(cookie_path)s to %(root)s to keep one conversation as the visitor moves "
"from page to page. The embed script keeps its own cookie, for the whole site."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter Chat guarda a chave em um cookie, %(cookie)s por padrão, por um "
"dia, e para o caminho da página, de modo que cada página tem sua própria "
"conversa. Defina %(cookie_path)s como %(root)s para manter uma só conversa "
"enquanto o visitante passa de uma página para outra. O script de "
"incorporação guarda o seu próprio cookie, para o site inteiro."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"The WordPress, Drupal and Shopify integrations, and the html snippet, use "
"Smarter Chat, so they need nothing more."
msgstr ""
"As integrações de WordPress, Drupal e Shopify, e o trecho de html, usam o "
"Smarter Chat, então não precisam de mais nada."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "In your own front end"
msgstr "No seu próprio front end"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Start a session"
msgstr "Inicie uma sessão"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Send %(config)s with no key, as the first command in How this url works "
"does. Its response's %(field)s is the new session's key."
msgstr ""
"Envie %(config)s sem chave, como faz o primeiro comando de Como esta url "
"funciona. O campo %(field)s da resposta é a chave da nova sessão."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Keep the key"
msgstr "Guarde a chave"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"In the browser, in localStorage or a cookie. In a server-to-server "
"integration, in your own database, beside your user, so that each of your "
"users has their own conversation."
msgstr ""
"No navegador, no localStorage ou em um cookie. Em uma integração de servidor "
"para servidor, no seu próprio banco de dados, junto ao seu usuário, para que "
"cada um dos seus usuários tenha sua própria conversa."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Send it with every prompt"
msgstr "Envie-a com cada prompt"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Add it to the body, as %(field)s. The request still carries the whole "
"conversation, in %(messages)s, and the platform adds the new messages to the "
"session."
msgstr ""
"Adicione-a ao corpo, como %(field)s. A solicitação continua levando a "
"conversa inteira, em %(messages)s, e a plataforma adiciona as mensagens "
"novas à sessão."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Come back to it"
msgstr "Volte a ela"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"After a reload, send %(config)s with the key. Its response's %(history)s is "
"the conversation so far, to display again, and its %(field)s is the same key."
msgstr ""
"Depois de um recarregamento, envie %(config)s com a chave. O campo %"
"(history)s da resposta é a conversa até aquele momento, para exibir de novo, "
"e o seu %(field)s é a mesma chave."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid "Keep a session key private"
msgstr "Mantenha a chave de sessão privada"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ChatSessions.tsx
msgid ""
"Anyone who has a session key, and can call this url, can read its "
"conversation, with the %(config)s request above. Don't put it in a url that "
"people share, in a log, or in an analytics event. It doesn't authenticate "
"the caller: an api key does that."
msgstr ""
"Qualquer pessoa que tenha uma chave de sessão, e possa chamar esta url, pode "
"ler a conversa dela, com a solicitação %(config)s acima. Não a coloque em "
"uma url que as pessoas compartilhem, em um log ou em um evento de análise. "
"Ela não autentica quem chama: isso é o que uma chave de API faz."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-vectorstore-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx
msgid "Deployed"
msgstr "Implantado"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/LLMProviderPassthroughRequest/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/LLMProviderSelector/Component.tsx
msgid "LLM provider"
msgstr "Provedor de LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/CardView/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/components/ListView/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-prompt-passthrough/src/components/LLMProviderPassthroughResponse/ResponseSummary.tsx
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Modelo"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Access"
msgstr "Acesso"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Api key required"
msgstr "Requer chave de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Public"
msgstr "Pública"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "This LLMClient"
msgstr "Este LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"Every request needs one of this LLMClient's api keys. A key that is in a web "
"page is public: give each site a key of its own, and revoke it if it is "
"abused."
msgstr ""
"Toda solicitação precisa de uma das chaves de API deste LLMClient. Uma chave "
"que está em uma página web é pública: dê a cada site sua própria chave, e "
"revogue-a se houver abuso."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"Anyone who has this url can chat with it, and every prompt is charged to its "
"owner. Attach an api key to require one, or give it a budget."
msgstr ""
"Qualquer pessoa que tenha esta url pode conversar com ele, e cada prompt é "
"cobrado do proprietário. Vincule uma chave de API para exigi-la, ou dê a ele "
"um orçamento."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Need to secure this url?"
msgstr "Precisa proteger esta url?"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Live"
msgstr "No ar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Not deployed yet"
msgstr "Ainda não implantado"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"%(app_name)s is live. Its system prompt, its LLM and its tools now answer at "
"its own url:"
msgstr ""
"%(app_name)s está no ar. Seu prompt de sistema, seu LLM e suas ferramentas "
"agora respondem em sua própria url:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"%(app_name)s works here, in the workbench, but nobody else can reach it yet. "
"Deploy it, and it gets its own url, with its own TLS certificate:"
msgstr ""
"%(app_name)s funciona aqui, na área de trabalho, mas ninguém mais pode "
"acessá-lo ainda. Implante-o e ele terá sua própria url, com seu próprio "
"certificado TLS:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"This url is an api, not a web page. It is the backend of Smarter Chat, the "
"chat window of the workbench, which is also the %(package)s npm package. Put "
"Smarter Chat on a web page, point it at this url, and your visitors are "
"talking to %(app_name)s."
msgstr ""
"Esta url é uma api, não uma página web. É o backend do Smarter Chat, a "
"janela de chat da área de trabalho, que também é o pacote npm %(package)s. "
"Coloque o Smarter Chat em uma página web, aponte-o para esta url, e seus "
"visitantes estarão conversando com %(app_name)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Deploy it with the smarter cli:"
msgstr "Implante-o com o cli do smarter:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter then creates its host and its TLS certificate, which can take a few "
"minutes. Reopen this tab afterwards. Until then, here is what you'll be able "
"to do with it."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter então cria seu host e seu certificado TLS, o que pode levar alguns "
"minutos. Reabra esta aba depois. Enquanto isso, veja o que você poderá fazer "
"com ele."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx
msgid "Back to the workbench"
msgstr "Voltar à área de trabalho"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Where to go from here?"
msgstr "E agora?"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/Hero.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "How this url works"
msgstr "Como esta url funciona"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Under the hood"
msgstr "Por dentro"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat sends this url two kinds of requests, and so can your own code. "
"Both are POST requests, with JSON in and JSON out. Copy a command into a "
"terminal to try it."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter Chat envia dois tipos de solicitação a esta url, e o seu próprio "
"código também pode. As duas são solicitações POST, com JSON na entrada e "
"JSON na saída. Copie um comando em um terminal para experimentar."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient requires a Smarter api key: replace <YOUR-API-KEY> with yours."
msgstr ""
"Este LLMClient exige uma chave de API do Smarter: substitua <YOUR-API-KEY> "
"pela sua."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "starts a chat"
msgstr "inicia um chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"It returns the LLMClient's configuration, such as its name, welcome message, "
"example prompts and colors, and a session_key for the new chat."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a configuração do LLMClient, como nome, mensagem de boas-vindas, "
"prompts de exemplo e cores, e um session_key para o novo chat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "sends a prompt"
msgstr "envia um prompt"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"It returns the messages that the prompt added to the chat. Send the "
"session_key with every prompt, and Smarter keeps the chat's history."
msgstr ""
"Retorna as mensagens que o prompt adicionou ao chat. Envie o session_key com "
"cada prompt, e o Smarter mantém o histórico do chat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Answers are Markdown"
msgstr "As respostas são Markdown"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"The response is JSON, and the assistant's message in it is Markdown. Smarter "
"Chat renders it, with code highlighting, math and diagrams. In your own "
"front end, use any Markdown library."
msgstr ""
"A resposta é JSON, e a mensagem do assistente nela é Markdown. O Smarter "
"Chat a renderiza, com destaque de código, matemática e diagramas. No seu "
"próprio front end, use qualquer biblioteca de Markdown."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Secrets stay on the server"
msgstr "Os segredos ficam no servidor"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter calls the LLM and runs the tools. Their api keys and credentials "
"never reach the browser."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter chama o LLM e executa as ferramentas. As chaves de API e as "
"credenciais deles nunca chegam ao navegador."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"The chat's configuration, and a new chat session, whose session_key "
"continues the chat in later prompts."
msgstr ""
"A configuração do chat, e uma nova sessão de chat, cujo session_key continua "
"o chat nos prompts seguintes."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid ""
"Sends the LLMClient's first example prompt, and returns the LLM's response."
msgstr ""
"Envia o primeiro prompt de exemplo do LLMClient e retorna a resposta do LLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Sends a prompt, and returns the LLM's response."
msgstr "Envia um prompt e retorna a resposta do LLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "The response, abbreviated:"
msgstr "A resposta, abreviada:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/HowThisUrlWorks.tsx
msgid "Things to ask it"
msgstr "Coisas para perguntar a ele"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "How it was built"
msgstr "Como foi construído"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "Designed in the workbench. Declared in YAML."
msgstr "Projetado na área de trabalho. Declarado em YAML."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"%(app_name)s was designed, tested and debugged in the Prompt Engineer's "
"Workbench of the Smarter web console, and is deployed from a manifest: a "
"short YAML file that declares everything it is. Change the manifest, apply "
"it, and the url answers with your changes."
msgstr ""
"%(app_name)s foi projetado, testado e depurado na área de trabalho do "
"engenheiro de prompts do console web do Smarter, e é implantado a partir de "
"um manifesto: um arquivo YAML curto que declara tudo o que ele é. Altere o "
"manifesto, aplique-o, e a url responde com suas alterações."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Declarative: the manifest says what the LLMClient is, and Smarter makes it "
"so."
msgstr ""
"Declarativo: o manifesto diz o que o LLMClient é, e o Smarter faz acontecer."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Version controlled: keep manifests in git, review them in pull requests, "
"apply them from CI."
msgstr ""
"Com controle de versão: mantenha os manifestos no git, revise-os em pull "
"requests, aplique-os a partir da CI."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Two commands from a YAML file to a live api with its own host and TLS "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Dois comandos para ir de um arquivo YAML a uma api no ar com seu próprio "
"host e certificado TLS."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "Open it in the workbench"
msgstr "Abra-o na área de trabalho"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid "LLMClient docs"
msgstr "Documentação do LLMClient"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/ManifestSection.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient's manifest, as smarter describe llmclient returns it, without "
"its owner's username. Its status is what Smarter reports about it, and is "
"read-only."
msgstr ""
"O manifesto deste LLMClient, como smarter describe llmclient o retorna, sem "
"o nome de usuário do proprietário. O status é o que o Smarter informa sobre "
"ele, e é somente leitura."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "This LLMClient isn't yours"
msgstr "Este LLMClient não é seu"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"%(name)s belongs to %(owner)s, who shares it with you. You can chat with it, "
"read its manifest and use everything on this page that only reads it, but "
"only its owner, or an admin of its account, can change it, deploy it or "
"attach an api key to it. That leaves you two choices."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s pertence a %(owner)s, que o compartilha com você. Você pode "
"conversar com ele, ler seu manifesto e usar tudo nesta página que apenas o "
"lê, mas só o seu proprietário, ou um administrador da sua conta, pode alterá-"
"lo, implantá-lo ou associar uma chave de api a ele. Isso deixa você com duas "
"opções."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "1. Leave it as it is"
msgstr "1. Deixe-o como está"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Use it as an example. Chat with it, read its manifest, and borrow whatever "
"you like for LLMClients of your own. Nothing that you do here changes it."
msgstr ""
"Use-o como exemplo. Converse com ele, leia seu manifesto e aproveite o que "
"quiser para os seus próprios LLMClients. Nada do que você fizer aqui o "
"altera."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "2. Clone it, and work on your copy"
msgstr "2. Clone-o e trabalhe na sua cópia"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A clone is a new LLMClient, owned by you, that starts as an exact copy of "
"this one: the same instructions, LLM provider and model, and the same "
"plugins, MCP clients and guardrails, except any that you aren't allowed to "
"use. It has its own name, and its own url. From then on the two are "
"independent: your changes to the copy never touch the original, and later "
"changes to the original never reach your copy."
msgstr ""
"Um clone é um novo LLMClient, de sua propriedade, que começa como uma cópia "
"exata deste: as mesmas instruções, o mesmo provedor e modelo de LLM, e os "
"mesmos plugins, clientes MCP e guardrails, exceto os que você não tem "
"permissão para usar. Ele tem seu próprio nome e sua própria url. A partir "
"daí os dois são independentes: suas alterações na cópia nunca afetam o "
"original, e as alterações posteriores no original nunca chegam à sua cópia."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Open the %(list)s list, and its %(tab)s tab."
msgstr "Abra a lista de %(list)s e a sua aba %(tab)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/App.tsx
msgid "Shared LLM Clients"
msgstr "Clientes LLM compartilhados"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Find %(name)s, and click its %(clone)s button, the green icon of two pages."
msgstr ""
"Encontre %(name)s e clique no seu botão %(clone)s, o ícone verde de duas "
"páginas."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Clone"
msgstr "Clonar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Type a name for your copy, and click %(ok)s. Smarter writes the name in "
"snake case: %(example)s becomes %(snake_case)s."
msgstr ""
"Digite um nome para a sua cópia e clique em %(ok)s. O Smarter escreve o nome "
"em snake case: %(example)s vira %(snake_case)s."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Your copy appears in the %(your_tab)s tab, under its new name, and the "
"original stays in %(shared_tab)s, unchanged. Open your copy in the "
"workbench, and from there edit its manifest, deploy it, and put it on your "
"site, as this page describes."
msgstr ""
"Sua cópia aparece na aba %(your_tab)s, com o novo nome, e o original "
"continua em %(shared_tab)s, sem alterações. Abra a sua cópia no workbench e, "
"de lá, edite seu manifesto, implante-a e coloque-a no seu site, como esta "
"página descreve."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx, react/packages/smarter-llmclient-list/src/App.tsx
msgid "Your LLM Clients"
msgstr "Seus clientes LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "How ownership of Smarter resources works"
msgstr "Como funciona a propriedade dos recursos do Smarter"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "who owns a resource, who can read it, and who can change it."
msgstr ""
"quem é o proprietário de um recurso, quem pode lê-lo e quem pode alterá-lo."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Your next step"
msgstr "Seu próximo passo"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Put %(app_name)s in front of people. Smarter Chat works on any web site, and "
"these integrations are ready to use: pick the one that matches yours. Each "
"of them needs only this LLMClient's url."
msgstr ""
"Coloque %(app_name)s diante das pessoas. O Smarter Chat funciona em qualquer "
"site, e estas integrações estão prontas para usar: escolha a que corresponde "
"ao seu. Cada uma precisa apenas da url deste LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "First, allow your site's origin"
msgstr "Primeiro, permita a origem do seu site"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Browsers let a page call this url only if the LLMClient's manifest lists the "
"page's origin: its scheme, host and port, without a path. Add your site, and "
"your development server if you have one, then apply the manifest again, in "
"the workbench's Manifest tab or with %(command)s. Skip this, and the chat "
"fails in the browser with a CORS error."
msgstr ""
"Os navegadores só permitem que uma página chame esta url se o manifesto do "
"LLMClient listar a origem da página: seu esquema, host e porta, sem caminho. "
"Adicione seu site, e seu servidor de desenvolvimento se tiver um, e depois "
"aplique o manifesto de novo, na aba Manifesto da área de trabalho ou com %"
"(command)s. Se pular esta etapa, o chat falha no navegador com um erro de "
"CORS."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A plugin: a chat launcher on every page, a Smarter Chat block, and a "
"[smarter_chat] shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Um plugin: um lançador de chat em todas as páginas, um bloco Smarter Chat e "
"um shortcode [smarter_chat]."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Download smarter-chat-<version>.zip from the plugin's latest release, and "
"upload it in Plugins, Add New, Upload Plugin."
msgstr ""
"Baixe smarter-chat-<version>.zip da versão mais recente do plugin e envie-o "
"em Plugins, Adicionar novo, Enviar plugin."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "In Settings, Smarter Chat, enter this LLMClient's url."
msgstr "Em Configurações, Smarter Chat, informe a url deste LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "Guia"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A module for Drupal 10.3 and 11: a chat launcher on every page, and a "
"Smarter Chat block for any region."
msgstr ""
"Um módulo para Drupal 10.3 e 11: um lançador de chat em todas as páginas, e "
"um bloco Smarter Chat para qualquer região."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Then, in Configuration, Web services, Smarter Chat, enter this LLMClient's "
"url."
msgstr ""
"Depois, em Configuração, Serviços web, Smarter Chat, informe a url deste "
"LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"A theme app extension: a chat launcher on every page, and a Smarter Chat "
"block for any section."
msgstr ""
"Uma extensão de app de tema: um lançador de chat em todas as páginas, e um "
"bloco Smarter Chat para qualquer seção."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Deploy the extension as your store's own app, from a Shopify Partner "
"account, and install it on your store."
msgstr ""
"Implante a extensão como o app da sua loja, a partir de uma conta Shopify "
"Partner, e instale-o na sua loja."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"In the theme editor, turn on App embeds, Smarter Chat launcher, and enter "
"this LLMClient's url."
msgstr ""
"No editor de temas, ative Incorporações de app, Smarter Chat launcher, e "
"informe a url deste LLMClient."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Allow both of your store's origins: its myshopify.com domain, and its own "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"Permita as duas origens da sua loja: o domínio myshopify.com e o domínio "
"próprio."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "React, from npm"
msgstr "React, a partir do npm"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"%(package)s, the component that the workbench uses, for a React 19 "
"application built with Vite, webpack or Next.js."
msgstr ""
"%(package)s, o componente que a área de trabalho usa, para uma aplicação "
"React 19 construída com Vite, webpack ou Next.js."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Any web page, in html"
msgstr "Qualquer página web, em html"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"One script tag, with no build: for a static site, a server-rendered page, "
"Squarespace, Wix or Webflow. Paste it before </body>, and a chat button "
"appears in a corner of the page."
msgstr ""
"Uma tag script, sem build: para um site estático, uma página renderizada no "
"servidor, Squarespace, Wix ou Webflow. Cole-a antes de </body>, e um botão "
"de chat aparece em um canto da página."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"The chat renders in its own Shadow DOM, so your site's css can't break it. "
"To put it inside the page instead of a launcher, add %(element)s where it "
"goes."
msgstr ""
"O chat é renderizado em seu próprio Shadow DOM, então o css do seu site não "
"consegue quebrá-lo. Para colocá-lo dentro da página em vez de um lançador, "
"adicione %(element)s onde ele deve ficar."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Something else?"
msgstr "Outra coisa?"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid ""
"Google Tag Manager, and documentation sites built with Docusaurus, MkDocs, "
"Sphinx or VitePress, have integrations too. Or build your own front end on "
"this url's api, below, or with the Python, Node.js and Go SDKs."
msgstr ""
"O Google Tag Manager, e os sites de documentação construídos com Docusaurus, "
"MkDocs, Sphinx ou VitePress, também têm integrações. Ou construa seu próprio "
"front end sobre a api desta url, abaixo, ou com os SDKs de Python, Node.js e "
"Go."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "Docs sites"
msgstr "Sites de documentação"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/NextSteps.tsx
msgid "SDKs"
msgstr "SDKs"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Give it to Smarter Chat"
msgstr "Entregue-a ao Smarter Chat"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter Chat sends the key with every request, as %(header)s. The WordPress, "
"Drupal and Shopify integrations have an api key setting. In html, add %"
"(attribute)s:"
msgstr ""
"O Smarter Chat envia a chave em toda solicitação, como %(header)s. As "
"integrações de WordPress, Drupal e Shopify têm uma configuração para a chave "
"de API. Em html, adicione %(attribute)s:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"In React, pass apiKey, from your build's environment rather than from your "
"source code:"
msgstr ""
"Em React, passe apiKey, a partir do ambiente do seu build e não do seu "
"código-fonte:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"An api key belongs to a staff user of your account, and a platform "
"administrator creates it with this command. The command prints the key's "
"name, and its secret, once: store the secret somewhere safe, such as a "
"password manager or your hosting's secrets."
msgstr ""
"Uma chave de API pertence a um usuário staff da sua conta, e um "
"administrador da plataforma a cria com este comando. O comando mostra o nome "
"da chave e o segredo, uma única vez: guarde o segredo em um lugar seguro, "
"como um gerenciador de senhas ou os segredos da sua hospedagem."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"The web console's API Keys page lists your keys, and turns a key off without "
"deleting it."
msgstr ""
"A página Chaves de API do console web lista suas chaves e desativa uma chave "
"sem excluí-la."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Name the key in the LLMClient's manifest, and apply the manifest again, in "
"the workbench's Manifest tab or with %(command)s. From then on, every "
"request to the url needs the key, and this page says \"Api key required\"."
msgstr ""
"Informe o nome da chave no manifesto do LLMClient e aplique o manifesto de "
"novo, na aba Manifesto da área de trabalho ou com %(command)s. A partir daí, "
"toda solicitação à url precisa da chave, e esta página mostra \"Requer chave "
"de API\"."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"To replace a key, create a new one, name it in the manifest instead, and "
"apply it: Smarter detaches the old key. Then turn the old key off."
msgstr ""
"Para substituir uma chave, crie uma nova, informe-a no manifesto no lugar da "
"anterior e aplique-o: o Smarter desvincula a chave anterior. Depois desative "
"a chave anterior."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "Api keys"
msgstr "Chaves de API"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"This LLMClient already requires an api key: the url answers only requests "
"that carry one of its keys. Here is how to give a key to a front end in "
"production, and how to replace one."
msgstr ""
"Este LLMClient já exige uma chave de API: a url só responde às solicitações "
"que levam uma de suas chaves. Veja como entregar uma chave a um front end em "
"produção, e como substituí-la."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Right now, anyone who has this url can chat with it, and every prompt is "
"charged to its owner. Attach an api key, and the url answers only requests "
"that carry it. The workbench keeps working, with your login."
msgstr ""
"No momento, qualquer pessoa que tenha esta url pode conversar com ele, e "
"cada prompt é cobrado do proprietário. Vincule uma chave de API, e a url só "
"responderá às solicitações que a levem. A área de trabalho continua "
"funcionando, com o seu login."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "You can do it right here."
msgstr "Você pode fazer isso aqui mesmo."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "A key in a web page is not a secret"
msgstr "Uma chave em uma página web não é um segredo"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"Anyone who opens the page can read the key in its source, and use it from "
"anywhere. On a public site, a key limits who can call the url, rather than "
"hiding it, so combine it with the rest:"
msgstr ""
"Qualquer pessoa que abra a página pode ler a chave no código-fonte e usá-la "
"de qualquer lugar. Em um site público, uma chave limita quem pode chamar a "
"url, em vez de escondê-la, então combine-a com o restante:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "give each site a key of its own, and turn it off if it is abused;"
msgstr "dê a cada site sua própria chave, e desative-a se houver abuso;"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"list only your site's origins in allowedOrigins, which browsers enforce;"
msgstr ""
"liste apenas as origens do seu site em allowedOrigins, que os navegadores "
"fazem cumprir;"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid "give the LLMClient a budget, which caps what its prompts can cost."
msgstr ""
"dê um orçamento ao LLMClient, que limita quanto seus prompts podem custar."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SecureUrl.tsx
msgid ""
"For an internal tool, or a server-to-server integration, keep the key on "
"your server, and call this url from there."
msgstr ""
"Para uma ferramenta interna, ou uma integração de servidor para servidor, "
"mantenha a chave no seu servidor e chame esta url a partir dele."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "The Smarter Project"
msgstr "The Smarter Project"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Build your own LLM applications"
msgstr "Construa suas próprias aplicações LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Prompt Engineer's Workbench"
msgstr "Área de trabalho do engenheiro de prompts"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid ""
"Write the system prompt, chat with the LLM, and watch every request, tool "
"call and response as it happens."
msgstr ""
"Escreva o prompt de sistema, converse com o LLM e acompanhe cada "
"solicitação, chamada de ferramenta e resposta em tempo real."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Declarative manifests"
msgstr "Manifestos declarativos"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid ""
"Every resource, from LLMClients to secrets, is a YAML manifest that you "
"apply with the cli or the api."
msgstr ""
"Cada recurso, dos LLMClients aos segredos, é um manifesto YAML que você "
"aplica com o cli ou a api."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Tools for the LLM"
msgstr "Ferramentas para o LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid ""
"Give an LLM your apis, databases and MCP servers, with plugins, extensions "
"and MCP clients."
msgstr ""
"Dê a um LLM suas apis, bancos de dados e servidores MCP, com plugins, "
"extensões e clientes MCP."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Your choice of LLM"
msgstr "O LLM que você escolher"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "Switch the LLM provider and model with one line of the manifest."
msgstr "Troque o provedor e o modelo do LLM com uma linha do manifesto."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid "One-command deploys"
msgstr "Implantação com um comando"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-llmclient-deployment/src/components/SmarterProject.tsx
msgid ""
"A deployed LLMClient gets its own host and TLS certificate, and can move to "
"your own domain."
msgstr ""
"Um LLMClient implantado tem seu próprio host e certificado TLS, e pode "
"passar para o seu próprio domínio."

