#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/Component.tsx
msgid "Chatbots, agents and harnesses, ready to run and customize."
msgstr "Chatbots, agentes e harnesses, prontos para executar e personalizar."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/Component.tsx
msgid ""
"Guides, manifests, the command-line interface and the API, at "
"docs.smarter.sh."
msgstr ""
"Guias, manifestos, a interface de linha de comando e a API, em "
"docs.smarter.sh."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/Component.tsx
