msgstr "Mostrar na inicialização"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Welcome to Smarter, %(firstName)s!"
msgstr "Boas-vindas ao Smarter, %(firstName)s!"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Welcome to Smarter!"
msgstr "Boas-vindas ao Smarter!"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter is a platform for designing and running the kinds of sophisticated "
"AI solutions that large organizations require. It is made for non-"
"programmers."
msgstr ""
"Smarter é uma plataforma para projetar e executar o tipo de soluções de IA "
"sofisticadas que grandes organizações exigem. Ela é feita para quem não "
"programa."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Free and open source"
msgstr "Livre e de código aberto"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Licensed under the GNU AGPL v3. Download it, read its source code, and run "
"it on your laptop."
msgstr ""
"Licenciado sob a GNU AGPL v3. Baixe-o, leia seu código-fonte e execute-o no "
"seu notebook."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Made for learning"
msgstr "Feito para aprender"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "A hands-on place to learn how real AI solutions are designed and built."
msgstr ""
"Um lugar prático para aprender como soluções reais de IA são projetadas e "
"construídas."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "No code required"
msgstr "Sem necessidade de programar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Every resource is a short YAML manifest that you can read, copy and change."
msgstr ""
"Cada recurso é um manifesto YAML curto que você pode ler, copiar e alterar."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Your account is ready to explore"
msgstr "Sua conta está pronta para explorar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Your new account is preloaded with dozens of AI resources and solutions. "
"Open any of them to see how it works, then customize it and make it your own."
msgstr ""
"Sua nova conta vem pré-carregada com dezenas de recursos e soluções de IA. "
"Abra qualquer um deles para ver como funciona, depois personalize-o e torne-"
"o seu."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Chatbots, agents and harnesses, each with its own LLM, system prompt and "
"tools."
msgstr ""
"Chatbots, agentes e harnesses, cada um com seu próprio LLM, prompt de "
"sistema e ferramentas."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "LLM Tools"
msgstr "Ferramentas de LLM"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Tool calling that connects an LLM to SQL databases, REST APIs, web search "
"and more."
msgstr ""
"Chamadas de ferramentas que conectam um LLM a bancos de dados SQL, APIs "
"REST, busca na web e muito mais."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Guardrails, secrets, API keys and budgets"
msgstr "Guardrails, segredos, chaves de API e orçamentos"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"The controls that organizations need to run AI safely and affordably, such "
"as API keys that secure your LLMClients."
msgstr ""
"Os controles de que as organizações precisam para executar IA com segurança "
"e a um custo acessível, como as chaves de API que protegem seus LLMClients."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Get hands-on with the real thing"
msgstr "Coloque a mão na massa com tecnologia real"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter supports popular generative AI technologies, vendors, protocols and "
"best practices. It's a good place to try them out and learn how they work."
msgstr ""
"Smarter oferece suporte a tecnologias, fornecedores, protocolos e boas "
"práticas populares de IA generativa. É um bom lugar para experimentá-los e "
"aprender como funcionam."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Thousands of LLMs from nine providers"
msgstr "Milhares de LLMs de nove provedores"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Anthropic, Cohere, Fireworks AI, Google AI, Hugging Face, Meta AI, Mistral, "
"OpenAI and Together AI, side by side."
msgstr ""
"Anthropic, Cohere, Fireworks AI, Google AI, Hugging Face, Meta AI, Mistral, "
"OpenAI e Together AI, lado a lado."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "MCP, Agent Skills and tool calling"
msgstr "MCP, Agent Skills e chamadas de ferramentas"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Connect LLMs to tools and data with the protocols that the industry uses."
msgstr "Conecte LLMs a ferramentas e dados com os protocolos que o setor usa."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Real prompts, real costs"
msgstr "Prompts reais, custos reais"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Every prompt is a real, billable request to an LLM provider. Experiment "
"freely, but please don't run automated loads."
msgstr ""
"Cada prompt é uma solicitação real e cobrada a um provedor de LLM. "
"Experimente à vontade, mas, por favor, não execute carga automatizada."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Connect MCP Servers"
msgstr "Conecte servidores MCP"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"MCP Servers give your LLMClients the tools of other services, through the "
"Model Context Protocol. Connect one, and its tools are ready for your "
"LLMClients to use, with no code to write."
msgstr ""
"Os servidores MCP dão aos seus LLMClients as ferramentas de outros serviços, "
"por meio do Model Context Protocol. Conecte um, e suas ferramentas ficam "
"prontas para seus LLMClients usarem, sem escrever código."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Dozens ready to connect"
msgstr "Dezenas prontos para conectar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "GitHub, Hugging Face, Notion, Linear, Sentry, Stripe and many more."
msgstr "GitHub, Hugging Face, Notion, Linear, Sentry, Stripe e muitos outros."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Your credentials stay secret"
msgstr "Suas credenciais continuam secretas"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"A server's access token is kept in an encrypted Smarter Secret, and you "
"choose which of its tools the LLM may call."
msgstr ""
"O token de acesso de um servidor fica guardado em um Secret criptografado do "
"Smarter, e você escolhe quais das ferramentas dele o LLM pode chamar."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Governed like everything else"
msgstr "Governados como todo o resto"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Every tool call is logged and charged, and is subject to the same access "
"controls as your other resources."
msgstr ""
"Cada chamada de ferramenta é registrada e cobrada, e está sujeita aos mesmos "
"controles de acesso que seus outros recursos."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Answer from your own documents"
msgstr "Responda a partir dos seus próprios documentos"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) lets an LLM answer from your own "
"material, such as manuals, policies and support articles, rather than from "
"its training data alone."
msgstr ""
"A geração aumentada por recuperação (RAG) permite que um LLM responda a "
"partir do seu próprio material, como manuais, políticas e artigos de "
"suporte, e não apenas dos seus dados de treinamento."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Vector databases, Qdrant or Pinecone, that Smarter creates and manages for "
"you. Add PDFs, text, web pages and more, and Smarter splits, embeds and "
"loads them."
msgstr ""
"Bancos de dados vetoriais, Qdrant ou Pinecone, que o Smarter cria e gerencia "
"para você. Adicione PDFs, textos, páginas da web e muito mais, e o Smarter "
"os divide, gera seus embeddings e os carrega."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Search by meaning"
msgstr "Busca por significado"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"A question finds the passages that are closest to it in meaning, not just "
"those that share its words, and the LLM answers from them."
msgstr ""
"Uma pergunta encontra os trechos mais próximos dela em significado, não "
"apenas os que compartilham suas palavras, e o LLM responde a partir deles."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Real databases, real costs"
msgstr "Bancos de dados reais, custos reais"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"A Vectorstore runs on real cloud infrastructure, which costs real money for "
"as long as it exists, whether or not anyone searches it."
msgstr ""
"Um Vectorstore é executado em infraestrutura real na nuvem, que custa "
"dinheiro real enquanto existir, quer alguém o consulte ou não."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Host open models yourself"
msgstr "Hospede você mesmo modelos abertos"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"LLMHosts run open-weight models on your own GPU servers, rather than calling "
"a provider's API. Your LLMClients use them just as they use a commercial "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Os LLMHosts executam modelos de pesos abertos nos seus próprios servidores "
"com GPU, em vez de chamar a API de um provedor. Seus LLMClients os usam "
"assim como usam um modelo comercial."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Models from Hugging Face"
msgstr "Modelos do Hugging Face"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Choose a model and a revision, and Smarter deploys it on Kubernetes with an "
"inference engine such as vLLM."
msgstr ""
"Escolha um modelo e uma revisão, e o Smarter o implanta no Kubernetes com um "
"mecanismo de inferência como o vLLM."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "You choose the hardware"
msgstr "Você escolhe o hardware"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Pick the kind of GPU node that the model runs on, and how much of it each "
"replica gets."
msgstr ""
"Escolha o tipo de nó com GPU em que o modelo é executado e quanto dele cada "
"réplica recebe."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Real servers, real costs"
msgstr "Servidores reais, custos reais"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"An LLMHost runs on real cloud infrastructure, which costs real money for as "
"long as it runs, whether or not anyone sends it a prompt."
msgstr ""
"Um LLMHost é executado em infraestrutura real na nuvem, que custa dinheiro "
"real enquanto estiver em execução, quer alguém lhe envie um prompt ou não."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Built for production, at scale"
msgstr "Feito para produção, em escala"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter runs AI solutions in production on Kubernetes, the same cloud "
"orchestration technology behind global platforms such as Netflix, YouTube "
"and TikTok."
msgstr ""
"O Smarter executa soluções de IA em produção no Kubernetes, a mesma "
"tecnologia de orquestração em nuvem por trás de plataformas globais como "
"Netflix, YouTube e TikTok."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "State-of-the-art orchestration"
msgstr "Orquestração de ponta"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Kubernetes grew out of Borg, the system that runs Google's services, YouTube "
"among them. Netflix and ByteDance, TikTok's parent, run their platforms on "
"it too."
msgstr ""
"O Kubernetes nasceu do Borg, o sistema que executa os serviços do Google, "
"entre eles o YouTube. A Netflix e a ByteDance, controladora do TikTok, "
"também executam suas plataformas nele."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Grows with demand"
msgstr "Cresce com a demanda"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Smarter's web servers and workers run as several copies, Kubernetes replaces "
"any that fail, and the cluster adds servers when they need more room."
msgstr ""
"Os servidores web e os workers do Smarter rodam em várias cópias, o "
"Kubernetes substitui as que falham, e o cluster adiciona servidores quando "
"elas precisam de mais espaço."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Every LLMClient at its own url"
msgstr "Cada LLMClient na sua própria url"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid ""
"Deploying an LLMClient gives it its own host name, with a TLS certificate "
"that the cluster issues and renews by itself."
msgstr ""
"Implantar um LLMClient dá a ele seu próprio nome de host, com um certificado "
"TLS que o cluster emite e renova sozinho."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "Where to start"
msgstr "Por onde começar"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-welcome/src/components/WelcomeDialog/steps.tsx
msgid "A few good first stops on your journey:"
msgstr "Algumas boas primeiras paradas na sua jornada:"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/App.tsx
