msgstr "Ainda não há chamadas de ferramentas nesta sessão de chat."

#. Translators: the tab of the Console that displays the chat's configuration.
#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/Component.tsx, react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/WorkbenchTour/steps.ts
msgid "Config"
msgstr "Configuração"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/Component.tsx
msgid "No config in this chat session yet."
msgstr "Ainda não há configuração nesta sessão de chat."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/Component.tsx
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Console"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/Component.tsx
msgid "Console output"
msgstr "Saída do console"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/Console/TabError.tsx
msgid "This tab couldn't load. Reload the page to try again."
msgstr ""
"Esta aba não pôde ser carregada. Recarregue a página para tentar de novo."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/Component.tsx
msgid ""
"Technical references for building LLMClients, and the applications that host "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Referências técnicas para criar LLMClients e as aplicações que os hospedam."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/Component.tsx
msgid "Audience"
msgstr "Público"

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/data.ts
msgid ""
"The chat workbench: sandbox and production modes, the Console, and the "
"server logs."
msgstr ""
"A área de trabalho do chat: os modos sandbox e de produção, o Console e os "
"logs do servidor."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/data.ts
msgid "The LLMClient class, which is the main interface to the Smarter API."
msgstr "A classe LLMClient, a principal interface da API do Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/data.ts
msgid "How to leverage LLM tool calling with Smarter."
msgstr "Como aproveitar as chamadas de ferramentas de LLMs com o Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/data.ts
msgid "How to create and use guardrails with the Smarter API."
msgstr "Como criar e usar guardrails com a API do Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/data.ts
msgid "How to create and use budgets with the Smarter API."
msgstr "Como criar e usar orçamentos com a API do Smarter."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/data.ts
msgid ""
"The npm package of this chat component, its props, and how to install it."
msgstr "O pacote npm deste componente de chat, suas props e como instalá-lo."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/data.ts
msgid "The REST api behind the chat: its configuration and prompt endpoints."
msgstr ""
"A api REST por trás do chat: seus endpoints de configuração e de prompts."

#. Translators: used in react/packages/smarter-workbench/src/components/DocsDialog/data.ts
